        "text_nYP7bU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>New Zealand winemakers are a rare breed: curious, collaborative, and deeply connected to the land. Many are growers as well as makers, hands on at every step, often working in remote, rugged conditions. They’re unbound by tradition but guided by instinct - keen to experiment, quick to share ideas, and fiercely committed to sustainability. </p><p> The result? Wines that reflect not just place, but personality - honest, expressive, and crafted by people who genuinely love what they do.</p><p> </p>",
